A yellow haired '''species''' with blue [[eye]]s existed in the galaxy. One member was [[Caspus Pillar]], who lived during the [[First Order-Resistance War|war]] between the [[First Order]] and the [[Resistance]].<ref name="RoS" /> Other individuals could be seen on [[Ferrix]] in the years of the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Kassa">{{Andor|Kassa (episode)}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
The species first appeared in the [[2019]] [[sequel trilogy]] film, [[Star Wars: Episode IX The Rise of Skywalker|''Star Wars'': Episode IX ''The Rise of Skywalker'']].<ref name="RoS" />

